 {
  "id": "4070f23d4b",
  "type": "raw",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"id-section\" id=\"interior-overview\"><div class=\"wrap id-cover-grid\">\n      <figure class=\"id-image id-cover-media id-reveal\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-c349a92a4ae0.webp\" alt=\"Interior visualization showing coordinated finishes, lighting and furniture\" width=\"2240\" height=\"1120\"><figcaption class=\"id-caption\">Layout, finishes and atmosphere resolved together</figcaption></figure>\n      <div class=\"id-cover-copy id-reveal\"><p class=\"id-label\">What interior design covers</p><h2>One clear plan for the whole interior</h2><p class=\"lead\">Good design balances function, beauty and comfort.</p><p>We plan how the space flows, then coordinate the colours, finishes, furniture, lighting and built-in storage. The result is a complete design package that can move into construction without guesswork.</p><div class=\"id-cover-list\"><div class=\"id-cover-item\"><strong>Space planning</strong><span>Furniture, circulation and smart storage.</span></div><div class=\"id-cover-item\"><strong>Materials and colour</strong><span>A cohesive palette for every surface.</span></div><div class=\"id-cover-item\"><strong>Lighting and furniture</strong><span>Pieces and fixtures selected around daily use.</span></div><div class=\"id-cover-item\"><strong>Drawings and 3D</strong><span>Review the result before the build starts.</span></div></div></div>\n    </div></section>"
 },
 {
  "id": "51ce34cc85",
  "type": "raw",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"id-section id-soft\" id=\"interior-services\" aria-labelledby=\"interior-services-title\"><div class=\"wrap\"><header class=\"id-head id-reveal\"><h2 id=\"interior-services-title\">Interior design services, room by room</h2><p>All ten specialist services from the Woodex design scope are shown here and ready to explore.</p></header><div class=\"id-services-shell\"><div class=\"id-services-viewport\"><div class=\"id-services-track\" id=\"id-services-track\" style=\"transform: translate3d(0px,0,0);\">\n      <a class=\"id-service\" href=\"/kitchen-design/\" data-page-route=\"kitchen\"><figure class=\"id-image id-service-media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-f655d51401e8.webp\" alt=\"Custom kitchen cabinetry and storage planning\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"></figure><div class=\"id-service-body\"><small>Kitchen</small><h3>Kitchen Design</h3><p>Layout, cabinetry, storage, worktops, finishes and task lighting.</p><div class=\"id-service-foot\"><span class=\"id-soon\">View service</span><span class=\"id-service-number\">01</span></div></div></a>\n      <a class=\"id-service\" href=\"/residential-bedroom-design/\" data-page-route=\"bedroom\"><figure class=\"id-image id-service-media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-42bae79b5c89.webp\" alt=\"Calm contemporary bedroom design with layered lighting and fitted storage\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"></figure><div class=\"id-service-body\"><small>Bedroom</small><h3>Bedroom Design</h3><p>Comfort, wardrobes, lighting and a calm material direction.</p><div class=\"id-service-foot\"><span class=\"id-soon\">View service</span><span class=\"id-service-number\">02</span></div></div></a>\n      <a class=\"id-service\" href=\"/residential-living-room-design/\" data-page-route=\"livingRoom\"><figure class=\"id-image id-service-media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-c349a92a4ae0.webp\" alt=\"Living room interior design placeholder\" width=\"2240\" height=\"1120\"></figure><div class=\"id-service-body\"><small>Living</small><h3>Living Room Design</h3><p>Seating, media walls, circulation and layered lighting.</p><div class=\"id-service-foot\"><span class=\"id-soon\">View service</span><span class=\"id-service-number\">03</span></div></div></a>\n      <a class=\"id-service\" href=\"/residential-dining-room-design/\" data-page-route=\"diningRoom\"><figure class=\"id-image id-service-media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-711f2ea6de04.jpg\" alt=\"Contemporary dining room with a six-seat table and pendant lighting\" width=\"960\" height=\"960\"></figure><div class=\"id-service-body\"><small>Dining</small><h3>Dining Room Design</h3><p>Proportion, furniture, lighting and connection to adjoining rooms.</p><div class=\"id-service-foot\"><span class=\"id-soon\">View service</span><span class=\"id-service-number\">04</span></div></div></a>\n      <a class=\"id-service\" href=\"/residential-home-office-design/\" data-page-route=\"homeOffice\"><figure class=\"id-image id-service-media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-1d6ad6c77d0f.webp\" alt=\"Home office design placeholder\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"></figure><div class=\"id-service-body\"><small>Home office</small><h3>Home Office Design</h3><p>A focused, practical workspace that still belongs in the home.</p><div class=\"id-service-foot\"><span class=\"id-soon\">View service</span><span class=\"id-service-number\">05</span></div></div></a>\n      <a class=\"id-service\" href=\"/residential-kids-room-design/\" data-page-route=\"kidsRoom\"><figure class=\"id-image id-service-media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-f655d51401e8.webp\" alt=\"Kids room storage and furniture design placeholder\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"></figure><div class=\"id-service-body\"><small>Kids room</small><h3>Kids Room Design</h3><p>Safe, adaptable rooms for sleep, play, learning and storage.</p><div class=\"id-service-foot\"><span class=\"id-soon\">View service</span><span class=\"id-service-number\">06</span></div></div></a>\n      <a class=\"id-service\" href=\"/residential-basement-design/\" data-page-route=\"basement\"><figure class=\"id-image id-service-media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-1f4b4ef86cb5.webp\" alt=\"Warm finished basement entertainment lounge with layered lighting\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"></figure><div class=\"id-service-body\"><small>Basement</small><h3>Basement Design</h3><p>Lighting, zoning and finishes for useful lower-ground space.</p><div class=\"id-service-foot\"><span class=\"id-soon\">View service</span><span class=\"id-service-number\">07</span></div></div></a>\n      <a class=\"id-service\" href=\"/complete-home-redesign/\" data-page-route=\"completeHome\"><figure class=\"id-image id-service-media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-c349a92a4ae0.webp\" alt=\"Complete home redesign placeholder\" width=\"2240\" height=\"1120\"></figure><div class=\"id-service-body\"><small>Whole home</small><h3>Complete Home Redesign</h3><p>One interior language coordinated across every room.</p><div class=\"id-service-foot\"><span class=\"id-soon\">View service</span><span class=\"id-service-number\">08</span></div></div></a>\n      <a class=\"id-service\" href=\"/interior-home-refurbishment/\" data-page-route=\"homeRefurbishment\"><figure class=\"id-image id-service-media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-5194dc486e09.webp\" alt=\"Refurbished Lahore living room with warm timber joinery and layered neutral furnishings\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"></figure><div class=\"id-service-body\"><small>Refresh</small><h3>Home Refurbishment</h3><p>Targeted improvements to finishes, furniture and built-ins.</p><div class=\"id-service-foot\"><span class=\"id-soon\">View service</span><span class=\"id-service-number\">09</span></div></div></a>\n      <a class=\"id-service\" href=\"/office-interior-design/\" data-page-route=\"officeInterior\"><figure class=\"id-image id-service-media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-1d6ad6c77d0f.webp\" alt=\"Office interior design placeholder\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"></figure><div class=\"id-service-body\"><small>Commercial</small><h3>Office Interior Design</h3><p>Planning, finishes and furniture shaped around the team.</p><div class=\"id-service-foot\"><span class=\"id-soon\">View service</span><span class=\"id-service-number\">10</span></div></div></a>\n    </div></div><div class=\"id-controls\"><span class=\"id-status\" id=\"id-service-status\" aria-live=\"polite\">01 / 10</span><button class=\"id-control\" id=\"id-service-prev\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Previous interior design service\" disabled=\"\">←</button><button class=\"id-control\" id=\"id-service-next\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Next interior design service\">→</button></div></div></div></section>"
 },
 {
  "id": "fd10d4d1aa",
  "type": "raw",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"id-section id-commercial-section\" id=\"interior-commercial\" aria-labelledby=\"interior-commercial-title\"><div class=\"wrap\"><header class=\"id-head id-reveal\"><h2 id=\"interior-commercial-title\">Commercial Interiors</h2><p>Woodex also designs offices, retail and hospitality spaces, planned around footfall, brand and how people work.</p></header><nav class=\"id-commercial-grid id-reveal\" aria-label=\"Commercial interior design services\">\n      <a class=\"id-commercial-card\" href=\"/office-interior-design/\" data-page-route=\"officeInterior\"><h3>Office Interior Design</h3><p>Workplaces planned around teams, focus and flow.</p></a>\n      <a class=\"id-commercial-card\" href=\"/coworking-space-design/\" data-page-route=\"coworking\"><h3>Coworking Space Design</h3><p>Flexible zones for focus, meetings and community.</p></a>\n      <a class=\"id-commercial-card\" href=\"/showroom-design/\" data-page-route=\"showroom\"><h3>Showroom Design</h3><p>Displays, lighting and movement planned to sell.</p></a>\n      <a class=\"id-commercial-card\" href=\"/shopping-mall-design/\" data-page-route=\"shoppingMall\"><h3>Shopping Mall Design</h3><p>Retail journeys shaped around footfall and visibility.</p></a>\n      <a class=\"id-commercial-card\" href=\"/retail-design/\" data-page-route=\"retail\"><h3>Retail Design</h3><p>Stores that make products easy to find and brands easy to remember.</p></a>\n      <a class=\"id-commercial-card\" href=\"/restaurant-interior-design/\" data-page-route=\"restaurant\"><h3>Restaurant Interior Design</h3><p>Dining rooms planned for atmosphere, service and smooth circulation.</p></a>\n      <a class=\"id-commercial-card\" href=\"/cafe-interior-design/\" data-page-route=\"cafe\"><h3>Café Interior Design</h3><p>Warm, efficient spaces that keep guests comfortable and service moving.</p></a>\n      <a class=\"id-commercial-card\" href=\"/hotel-interior-design/\" data-page-route=\"hotel\"><h3>Hotel Interior Design</h3><p>Guest spaces that feel consistent from arrival to room.</p></a>\n      <a class=\"id-commercial-card\" href=\"/beauty-salon-design/\" data-page-route=\"beautySalon\"><h3>Beauty Salon Design</h3><p>Calm, polished salons with practical service flow.</p></a>\n      <a class=\"id-commercial-card\" href=\"/spa-design/\" data-page-route=\"spa\"><h3>Spa Design</h3><p>Quiet, restorative spaces built around privacy and comfort.</p></a>\n      <a class=\"id-commercial-card\" href=\"/gym-design/\" data-page-route=\"gym\"><h3>Gym Design</h3><p>Clear training zones, durable finishes and safe circulation.</p></a>\n      <a class=\"id-commercial-card\" href=\"/healthcare-design/\" data-page-route=\"healthcare\"><h3>Healthcare Design</h3><p>Reassuring spaces shaped around hygiene, privacy and patient flow.</p></a>\n    </nav><div class=\"id-commercial-footer id-reveal\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/commercial-interior/\" data-page-route=\"commercialInterior\">View all Commercial Interiors</a></div></div></section>"
 },
 {
  "id": "4fdf0b8e17",
  "type": "raw",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"id-section id-dark\" id=\"interior-spaces\"><div class=\"wrap id-space-grid\"><div class=\"id-space-intro id-reveal\"><div><p class=\"id-label\">Design by space</p><h2>Homes and commercial interiors need different answers.</h2><p>Both follow one clear process: understand, plan, select, visualize and document.</p></div><figure class=\"id-image id-space-media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-1d6ad6c77d0f.webp\" alt=\"Wide commercial interior showing planned circulation and lighting\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"></figure></div><div class=\"id-space-panels id-reveal\"><article class=\"id-space-panel\"><h3>Residential</h3><p>Comfort, storage and personal routines guide every room.</p><ul><li>Kitchens and bedrooms</li><li>Living and dining rooms</li><li>Home offices and kids rooms</li><li>Basements and complete homes</li></ul></article><article class=\"id-space-panel\"><h3>Commercial</h3><p>Customer flow, team needs and brand standards shape the design.</p><ul><li>Offices and workplaces</li><li>Retail and showrooms</li><li>Restaurants and hospitality</li><li>Healthcare interiors</li></ul></article></div></div></section>"
 },
 {
  "id": "0119eb8601",
  "type": "raw",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"id-section\" id=\"interior-styles\"><div class=\"wrap id-style-layout\"><figure class=\"id-image id-style-stage id-reveal\"><img id=\"id-style-image\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-c349a92a4ae0.webp\" alt=\"Modern interior design style with clean lines and warm materials\" width=\"2240\" height=\"1120\"><figcaption class=\"id-caption\" id=\"id-style-caption\">Modern · clean lines and purposeful detail</figcaption></figure><div class=\"id-style-copy id-reveal\"><p class=\"id-label\">Style, without a formula</p><h2>Six directions. One should feel like yours.</h2><p>These are starting points, not templates. Materials, proportion and detail are tailored to the space and the people using it.</p><div class=\"id-style-list\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Interior design styles\"><button class=\"id-style-button\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-image=\"/assets/img/img-c349a92a4ae0.webp\" data-alt=\"Modern interior design style\" data-caption=\"Modern · clean lines and purposeful detail\"><span>01</span><strong>Modern</strong><em>Clean and composed</em></button><button class=\"id-style-button\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-image=\"/assets/img/img-f655d51401e8.webp\" data-alt=\"Traditional Pakistani interior design style\" data-caption=\"Traditional Pakistani · layered colour and craft\"><span>02</span><strong>Traditional Pakistani</strong><em>Rich and crafted</em></button><button class=\"id-style-button\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-image=\"/assets/img/img-c349a92a4ae0.webp\" data-alt=\"Contemporary minimal interior design style\" data-caption=\"Contemporary minimal · quiet materials and light\"><span>03</span><strong>Contemporary Minimal</strong><em>Calm and uncluttered</em></button><button class=\"id-style-button\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-image=\"/assets/img/img-f655d51401e8.webp\" data-alt=\"Branded themed commercial interior style\" data-caption=\"Branded and themed · identity built into the room\"><span>04</span><strong>Branded &amp; Themed</strong><em>Distinctive and ownable</em></button><button class=\"id-style-button\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-image=\"/assets/img/img-1d6ad6c77d0f.webp\" data-alt=\"Biophilic interior design style\" data-caption=\"Biophilic · natural materials and wellbeing\"><span>05</span><strong>Biophilic</strong><em>Natural and restorative</em></button><button class=\"id-style-button\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-image=\"/assets/img/img-1d6ad6c77d0f.webp\" data-alt=\"Industrial interior design style\" data-caption=\"Industrial · honest structure and texture\"><span>06</span><strong>Industrial</strong><em>Raw and functional</em></button></div></div></div></section>"
 },
 {
  "id": "d72a86da38",
  "type": "process",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"id-section id-dark\" id=\"interior-process\"><div class=\"wrap id-process-layout\"><div class=\"id-process-sticky id-reveal\"><p class=\"id-label\">From brief to design package</p><h2>Five decisions, made in the right order.</h2><p>Each step resolves the next. That keeps late changes and site surprises to a minimum.</p><figure class=\"id-image id-process-media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-dce06249b137.webp\" alt=\"Woodex project exterior representing coordinated design delivery\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"><figcaption class=\"id-caption\">Typical design timeline · 1 to 3 weeks</figcaption></figure></div><div><div class=\"id-process-list id-reveal\" id=\"id-process-list\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Interior design process\"><article class=\"id-step\"><h3>Consultation</h3><p>We understand the space, routines, taste, budget and timeline.</p></article><article class=\"id-step\"><h3>Site Measurement</h3><p>Walls, openings, services and existing elements are recorded accurately.</p></article><article class=\"id-step\"><h3>Concept &amp; Layout</h3><p>Furniture, circulation, storage and focal points establish the plan.</p></article><article class=\"id-step\"><h3>Materials &amp; Furniture</h3><p>Colours, finishes, lighting, curtains and furniture are coordinated.</p></article><article class=\"id-step is-active\"><h3>Final Package &amp; 3D</h3><p>Drawings, specifications and renders show exactly what will be built.</p></article></div><p class=\"id-timeline\">Scroll this panel to follow the complete process.</p></div></div></section>",
  "fields": {
   "steps": [
    {
     "title": "Consultation",
     "copy": "We understand the space, routines, taste, budget and timeline."
    },
    {
     "title": "Site Measurement",
     "copy": "Walls, openings, services and existing elements are recorded accurately."
    },
    {
     "title": "Concept &amp; Layout",
     "copy": "Furniture, circulation, storage and focal points establish the plan."
    },
    {
     "title": "Materials &amp; Furniture",
     "copy": "Colours, finishes, lighting, curtains and furniture are coordinated."
    },
    {
     "title": "Final Package &amp; 3D",
     "copy": "Drawings, specifications and renders show exactly what will be built."
    }
   ],
   "label": "From brief to design package",
   "heading": "Five decisions, made in the right order."
  }
 },
 {
  "id": "5ecb974ac7",
  "type": "raw",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"id-section\" id=\"interior-pricing\"><div class=\"wrap id-price-grid\"><div class=\"id-price-copy id-reveal\"><p class=\"id-label\">Indicative PKR fees</p><h2>A clear design fee before construction begins.</h2><p class=\"lead\">The number of rooms, level of detail and drawing scope set the final price.</p><div class=\"id-price-list\"><div class=\"id-price-row\"><strong>Consultation</strong><b>PKR 5K–15K</b><span>One session with practical recommendations.</span></div><div class=\"id-price-row\"><strong>Single Room</strong><b>PKR 15K–35K</b><span>Layout, materials, furniture, 3D and specification.</span></div><div class=\"id-price-row\"><strong>2–3 Rooms</strong><b>PKR 30K–70K</b><span>Coordinated design with multiple 3D views.</span></div><div class=\"id-price-row\"><strong>Complete Home</strong><b>PKR 50K–150K+</b><span>All rooms and a complete home design package.</span></div><div class=\"id-price-row\"><strong>Commercial Space</strong><b>PKR 30K–100K+</b><span>Technical drawings prepared for BOQ and build.</span></div></div><p class=\"id-price-note\">Design fees are separate from construction and fit-out. Exact quote after consultation.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#interior-contact\">Discuss your space</a></div><figure class=\"id-image id-price-media id-reveal\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-f655d51401e8.webp\" alt=\"Material samples and custom joinery representing interior design selections\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"><figcaption class=\"id-caption\">Every selection documented before ordering</figcaption></figure></div></section>"
 },
 {
  "id": "a31e0d7d8d",
  "type": "raw",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"id-section id-soft\" id=\"interior-connections\"><div class=\"wrap id-connect-grid\"><figure class=\"id-image id-connect-visual id-reveal\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-dce06249b137.webp\" alt=\"Woodex build project representing the connection between design and delivery\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"><figcaption class=\"id-caption\">One approved design can move into a coordinated build</figcaption></figure><div class=\"id-connect-copy id-reveal\"><p class=\"id-label\">After the design</p><h2>Take the plan into delivery with one team.</h2><p>Interior design can stand alone, or connect directly with the Woodex teams that document, build, renovate and visualize the space.</p><nav class=\"id-connect-list\" aria-label=\"Related Woodex services\"><a class=\"id-connect-link\" href=\"/fit-out/\"><span>01</span><strong>Fit Out</strong><span>→</span></a><a class=\"id-connect-link\" href=\"/renovation/\"><span>02</span><strong>Renovation</strong><span>→</span></a><a class=\"id-connect-link\" href=\"/architecture/\"><span>03</span><strong>Architecture</strong><span>→</span></a><a class=\"id-connect-link\" href=\"/3d-visualization/\"><span>04</span><strong>3D Studio</strong><span>→</span></a></nav></div></div></section>"
 },
 {
  "id": "20006b0055",
  "type": "raw",
  "html": "\n\n    <section class=\"id-section id-dark\" id=\"interior-faq\"><div class=\"wrap id-faq-grid\"><div class=\"id-faq-side id-reveal\"><p class=\"id-label\">Before we begin</p><h2>Interior Design FAQ</h2><figure class=\"id-image id-faq-media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/img/img-f655d51401e8.webp\" alt=\"Finished showroom interior accompanying interior design questions\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\"><figcaption class=\"id-caption\">Clear answers before design starts</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"faq-wrap id-reveal\">\n      <div class=\"faq-item\"><button class=\"faq-q\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><span>What does an interior designer do?</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><div><p>We plan and specify the layout, materials, colours, furniture, lighting and finishes, then create the 3D views and technical drawings.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><button class=\"faq-q\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>What is the difference between design and fit-out?</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><div><p>Interior design creates the plan. Fit-out is the construction and installation stage that builds the approved plan.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><button class=\"faq-q\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>Do I need design before renovation?</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><div><p>It is recommended when the layout, materials or overall direction still need to be resolved. A clear design helps prevent expensive site changes.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><button class=\"faq-q\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>How long does interior design take?</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><div><p>A typical design package takes 1 to 3 weeks, depending on the number of rooms and complexity.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><button class=\"faq-q\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>Is 3D visualization included?</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><div><p>Yes. Every Woodex interior design package includes 3D visualization so you can review the finished direction before construction.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><button class=\"faq-q\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>Can you design just one room?</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><div><p>Yes. Kitchens, bedrooms, living rooms, dining rooms, home offices, kids rooms and basements can be commissioned individually.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><button class=\"faq-q\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>How much does interior design cost in Lahore?</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><div><p>Single-room design starts from PKR 15,000. Complete-home and commercial fees depend on size and the required drawing package.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><button class=\"faq-q\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>Do you design commercial spaces?</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><div><p>Yes. Woodex designs offices, retail, hospitality and healthcare interiors as well as homes.</p></div></div></div>\n    </div></div></section>"
 },
 {
